  Use it when: after **Drishti: run server (demo)** and **Drishti: run console** are up.
  PyCharm: open drishti/drishti-console as the project (the install folder is $PROJECT_DIR$/..); it runs on the project
  interpreter you choose (Settings, Project, Python Interpreter), the one setup prepared.
  The profile config/profiles/demo.ini (after your dev.ini) holds its settings.
  Generated from tools/launch/launchers.yaml by python tools/drishti.py launchers: never edit this file, edit the table.
